<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Publishing/info services sector.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Publishing/info services sector.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Kevin Gruneich confirmed that he initiated coverage of the publishing/information services sector.</p>
<p>-- Following are stocks initiated with buy ratings, followed by their 16-18 month price targets:</p>
<p>-- Tribune Co, $87-$88;</p>
<p>-- Knight-Ridder Inc, $45-$46;</p>
<p>-- E.W. Scripps Co, $61-$62</p>
<p>-- Harte-Hanks Communications Inc, $34-$35;</p>
<p>-- Bell &amp; Howell Co, $39-$40.  </p>
<p>-- Gruneich also said he initiated coverage of Times Mirror Co, Equifax Inc, Gannett Co Inc, K-III Communications and New York Times Co with attractive ratings.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
</text>
